### Change 3: Rework the "How It Works" Section

The current "How It Works (Developer View)" section talks about manifest hosting and CORS — which isn't how Claude web connectors work. Replace it with a two-track view:

**Track A — Individual Users:**
```
1. Sign up at app.fodda.ai and get your API key
2. Add Fodda as a custom connector in Claude (Settings → Connectors)
3. Start querying — Claude calls Fodda's tools automatically
```

**Track B — Enterprise / Developer:**
```
1. Register the MCP endpoint via your Claude Enterprise admin console
2. Configure auth (Bearer token or OIDC)
3. Optionally self-host the MCP server for full control
```

